## Version: 2.2.0
## Notes: Player buffs and debuffs on the player unit frame wearing Blizzard's own aura art — with the client's aura frames hidden — plus a loss-of-control light on your portrait: stunned, silenced, feared, rooted, named in a word the instant it lands, with a radial duration ring. The whole policy is editable in a live rule editor.
